{"about_the_game":"<strong>Contract Rush DX</strong> (Also known as simply <i>Contract Rush</i>), is a hand-animated run and gun, with multiple playable characters and a focus on exploration and story! Complete Contracts and collect power-ups that strengthen you immensely, all culminating in massive boss fights! With inspiration from flash cartoons/games of the 2000s, the visuals are hand-animated with a sharp and bold style.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775960/extras/steam_1.png?t=1744669995\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775960/extras/steam6.gif?t=1744669995\" /><br><br>Taking on <strong>Contracts</strong> will have you exploring large levels, all with their own set of enemies, NPCs, and secrets!<br><i>Power-ups</i> will prepare you for the Contract's boss battle at the end of the level. Power-ups can increase movement speed, spread-shot bullets, fire rate, and much more!<br><br><br><strong>Sub-Contracts</strong> will have you taking on smaller challenge levels with a variety of objectives. Earn all 3 stars in each and get rewards!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775960/extras/steam_2.png?t=1744669995\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775960/extras/steam8.gif?t=1744669995\" /><br><br><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong>, all with unique play styles. Some are focused on pure shoot'em up gameplay, others centered around melee attacks. If you're having trouble on a level, sometimes trying out a new character is the key!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1775960/extras/steammmmmmm.gif?t=1744669995\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1775960?t=